WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
This clip was made for the nuvui docs,
from shapes, words and tones.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The first part is called Getting started.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Each part has its own color
and its own note.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
This one is Building the screen.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<i>A beep marks every second.</i>

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
And the last part is Shipping it.
